# Generated bank data -- rebuild with `npm run sync-assets`
# (source of truth: each bank's original --e4b/--ebl-dir/--wav-dir inputs,
# see tools/build_bank.py). Bank JSON is cheap to regenerate; WAV assets
# are large binary audio and don't belong in the app's own git history.
